WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.410
- Alright I've got one more
gift for you this hour.

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.910
A sweet story to give you
all the holiday feels.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.076
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.076 --> 00:00:09.430
(short guitar riff)
(crowd cheering)

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.060
More than 65 years ago,

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.840
a then high school graduate Anita,

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.780
received a gift from her mom's friend.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.300
Her very first Santa Claus trinket.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.600
Anita fell in love.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.630
After that friends and
family started buying her

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:21.690
more and more.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.830
And then she bought more herself.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.750
Then random strangers
started sending them to her.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:29.580
She's now amassed over 3,500 Santas,

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.020
all carefully set up in a
makeshift museum inside her

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:34.350
Alabama home.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.183
Over the years,

00:00:35.183 --> 00:00:36.910
she's had hundreds of people come to visit

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.370
and bask in the magic of her collection.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.180
We have Anita on the line right now.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.083
Hi Anita.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.430
- Hey Kelly.

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:46.263
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:46.263 --> 00:00:48.440
It looks so magical where you are.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.830
I wish I was there in person.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:50.830
It's nice to meet you.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.230
You must really love Santa.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.440
- I do.

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:56.430
It brings such joy and cheer to people.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.862
Men, women and children.

00:00:58.862 --> 00:01:02.510
And my children believe in Santa.

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:04.020
And they're in their fifties.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:05.680
I told them when they were little,

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:07.540
if you don't believe
in Santa you don't get

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:09.447
nothing from Santa Claus under the tree.

00:01:09.447 --> 00:01:12.303
(Kelly laughing and clapping)

00:01:12.303 --> 00:01:14.740
- I mean, my children do as well.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.830
And they still hear the
bell for Polar Express.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.670
So can you show us around a little?

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.893
- Absolutely.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.580
This is Huntsville, Alabama Santa museum.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:25.500
- I love it.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.510
- These are toys.

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:28.650
These are all toys.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.530
And over here are bubble blowers

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:32.590
and other things.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:33.433
Furbies.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.210
And around over here,

00:01:37.210 --> 00:01:39.980
is my little Santa Bill.

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:42.560
Got it in Cocoa, Florida in 1955

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.280
from a friend of my mother's.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.630
That started my collection,

00:01:45.630 --> 00:01:47.650
but I didn't know I was going to collect,

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:49.760
But I guess I'm a collector.

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:51.340
Anyhow, this is my favorite.

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:52.560
This is,

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:55.790
Jesus with Santa Claus,

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:57.580
and it's a music box.

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:58.823
And over here,

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:01.313
this big old Santa,

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:04.010
he scared my granddaughter to death

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.990
because he dances,

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:07.120
and he sings,

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.170
and he moves.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:10.610
And I had to unplug him
and bring her up here

00:02:10.610 --> 00:02:14.880
and let her hold his hand
to see that he was not real.

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:16.500
And I have one that-

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.870
the big one that playing the piano

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:20.680
and the big one in the hammock.

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:22.940
They are Coca-Cola stuffed Santas.

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:25.570
This one rides in my Cadillac,

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:27.800
in the back seat with a seat belt.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.580
And my husband will not
go to church with me

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:32.960
in my car with that Santa.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:33.793
So I said,

00:02:33.793 --> 00:02:34.951
well you just drive your own car.

00:02:34.951 --> 00:02:35.784
(laughing)

00:02:35.784 --> 00:02:37.310
So we both went to church,

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:38.820
but in separate cars.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:40.700
He thought I was nuts.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:41.868
Merry Christmas.

00:02:41.868 --> 00:02:43.360
- Thank you so much Anita,

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:44.300
for joining us.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.470
I love your whole museum.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:47.303
It's so cool.

00:02:47.303 --> 00:02:48.136
It's magical.

00:02:48.136 --> 00:02:49.300
And it makes everyone happy.

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.190
And I'm liking your posts right now,

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:52.023
all right?

00:02:52.023 --> 00:02:54.635
(crowd cheering)

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.640
And Anita,

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:58.990
that's not all.

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.290
Our season-long partner,

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:02.080
Pilot pen makers of Frixion,

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.290
the go-to erasable pen of
the Kelly Clarkson show

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.470
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:07.610
Just like you ma'am.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:09.520
So they're going to give you $1,000.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.370
How's that sound?

00:03:11.342 --> 00:03:12.869
- Well thank you.

00:03:12.869 --> 00:03:13.702
- You're welcome.

00:03:13.702 --> 00:03:15.674
- Thank you for sharing.

00:03:15.674 --> 00:03:16.757
- Absolutely.

